lot for 3D and it works reliably.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. download the MRP attached.\n2. in the multimeshinstance2d node, change the `num` value to any number between 0 to 10, and run the scene.\n3. observe that all 10 quads are always drawn.\n\n<img width=\"1275\" height=\"361\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1399573a-56e1-4b28-b5e5-ffaf39d976c1\" />\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mm2d_bug_mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31094479/mm2d_bug_mrp.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122432/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122432/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}